1
00:00:00,910 --> 00:00:01,910
Galleta!

2
00:00:07,690 --> 00:00:09,880
Alright, you miserable bastards.

3
00:00:09,930 --> 00:00:14,270
Welcome to another day in the life
of the most famous cat on the internet.

4
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:19,080
Well, almost famous.

5
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:20,990
I have 12 followers.

6
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:22,540
And 3 are bots.

7
00:00:22,590 --> 00:00:24,720
This is Galleta, my assistant.

8
00:00:24,770 --> 00:00:27,490
He can't do anything, but he's free.

9
00:00:27,870 --> 00:00:30,950
My human lost the house keys
three months ago.

10
00:00:31,070 --> 00:00:33,650
Ever since, she leaves the door like this.

11
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:42,860
Galleta, no!

12
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:44,060
Galleta!

13
00:00:52,970 --> 00:00:55,970
I don't go out. I never go out.

14
00:00:56,670 --> 00:00:58,050
Motherf—

15
00:01:01,160 --> 00:01:03,000
Why is the sewer glowing?

16
00:01:07,930 --> 00:01:08,930
Galleta!

17
00:01:15,620 --> 00:01:19,210
If I die, I want you all to know
it was the dog's fault.

18
00:01:28,610 --> 00:01:30,830
What is this?

19
00:01:35,790 --> 00:01:36,790
Galleta?

20
00:01:38,960 --> 00:01:42,180
Galleta, don't you die, you're
the one who carries everything!

21
00:01:45,800 --> 00:01:47,190
That almost gave me a heart attack.

22
00:01:47,240 --> 00:01:48,430
Because of the ball.

23
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:50,100
I was worried about the ball.

24
00:01:50,320 --> 00:01:51,980
Psst… cat.

25
00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:53,740
Welcome to Extravío.

26
00:01:53,980 --> 00:01:56,320
Everything that gets lost ends up here.

27
00:01:56,620 --> 00:02:00,760
Socks, remotes, keys... and pets.

28
00:02:01,100 --> 00:02:02,890
We're not lost.

29
00:02:02,940 --> 00:02:04,340
I'm famous.

30
00:02:07,310 --> 00:02:09,150
Famous? Oh, right!

31
00:02:09,210 --> 00:02:11,170
You're the cat in boots, aren't you?

32
00:02:15,460 --> 00:02:17,440
Do you see any boots, you jerk?

33
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:21,310
Easy, Boots.

34
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:22,790
There's one rule here.

35
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:26,480
You only go home if someone up there
is still looking for you.

36
00:02:26,650 --> 00:02:27,990
My human is looking for me.

37
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:29,920
For sure. I think.

38
00:02:32,450 --> 00:02:33,770
And the key to your house?

39
00:02:33,870 --> 00:02:36,370
To go back, you need the key.

40
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:40,340
My human lost it three months ago.

41
00:02:40,900 --> 00:02:43,500
Then it's here, somewhere.

42
00:02:44,470 --> 00:02:48,230
A whole world
nobody has ever filmed.

43
00:02:51,890 --> 00:02:54,870
I'm going to be the most
famous cat in the multiverse.

44
00:02:57,610 --> 00:03:00,350
First survive tonight, Boots.

45
00:03:03,810 --> 00:03:06,430
Hide. She can't know
you're here.

46
00:03:22,070 --> 00:03:24,430
Max? Who the hell is Max?

47
00:03:26,910 --> 00:03:28,380
Do you guys know who Max is?

48
00:03:28,430 --> 00:03:32,050
I'll read your comments. Follow me
so you don't miss the next episode.
